Z||000002||JohnnyK||04-14-2000||02:49 PM||||Ahh yes.. I had the same problem... Check for the tach filter, it's a little cylindrical thing about 3 inches long hanging down beside the distributor (Don't know where on the 6cyl).. mine had a plug, so I just found a new one and put it in, but the ones at the junk yard were just attached directly.. In any case, I soldered up the new one, and now it works  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
